          "text": "I will write a Substack piece on this topic but just a short missive here: I am amazed by the fact that this situation at the end of his premiership known as three rural crises, 三农危机, is now completely forgotten, even by China specialists. NYT is working on a piece that may revisit this topic. I will see if the piece gives the topic the weight it deserves. (Just a gentle reminder: China was 70 to 80 percent rural in the 1990s.)"
